<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Naekkeo 😘✨</title>

<style>
*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
}

body{
background:#000;
color:white;
text-align:center;
overflow-x:hidden;
}

.container{
padding:40px 20px;
}

h1{
font-size:42px;
color:#ff4da6;
text-shadow:0 0 15px #ff4da6;
margin-bottom:15px;
}

p{
font-size:18px;
line-height:1.7;
color:#ddd;
margin-bottom:20px;
}

button{
background:#ff4da6;
color:white;
padding:15px 35px;
border:none;
border-radius:40px;
font-size:18px;
cursor:pointer;
box-shadow:0 0 20px #ff4da6;
transition:.3s;
}

button:hover{
transform:scale(1.08);
background:#ff66b3;
}

.card{
background:#111;
margin:30px auto;
padding:25px;
border-radius:20px;
width:90%;
max-width:700px;
box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(255,77,166,.4);
}

.footer{
margin-top:40px;
font-size:22px;
color:#ff4da6;
text-shadow:0 0 10px #ff4da6;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

<h1>Naekkeo 😘✨</h1>

<p>
Every Relationship Is Beautiful,<br>
But Ours Is My Favorite ❤️
</p>

<button>Open My Heart ❤️</button>

<div class="card">
<h2>💌 Letter</h2>

<p>
My Dearest Thangoo ❤️<br><br>

You are my safest place, my biggest happiness, and my favorite person.<br><br>

Every hug, every smile, every little moment with you has become my most precious memory.<br><br>

Even when we're miles apart, I feel your love every single day.<br><br>

I love you forever. ❤️<br><br>

— Your Sweetheart 
</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>🤗 Virtual Hug</h2>

<p>
Close your eyes... ❤️<br><br>

Imagine I'm wrapping my arms around you tightly.<br><br>

This hug carries all my love until I can give you a real one.
</p>
</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>🎵 Our Song ❤️</h2>

<p>
Every time this song plays...<br>
I think of you. ❤️
</p>

<button onclick="window.open('https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LWYikVCSbAk','_blank')">
🎵 Play Thangame ❤️
</button>

</div>

<div class="footer">
Forever & Always ❤️<br>
Naekkeo 😘✨
</div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
